TEXT -200 152 Left 2 !Vin in 0 SIN(0 {vin} 50)          ; AC-Quelle 10kV, 50Hz\n  \nRload out out2 10                 ; Lastwiderstand 10 Ohm\nLLoad out2 0 {10/314.159}\n \nXmov1 out 0 mov1 params: vbo={vin} exp=9\nXmov2 in 0 mov1 params: vbo={vin} exp=9\n \nRs in x {Rs}\nCs x out {Cs}\n \nxbrp ctrl brkp_ctrl1 params: c1=0.1n\n \n* Gate-Puls: \nVgate gate1 0 pwl 0s 1 18ms 1 18.01ms 0 31ms 0 31.01ms 1 36ms 1 36.1m 0 50ms 0 50.1ms 1\n \n.tran 0 100m 0 100u
TEXT 280 272 Left 2 !* mov ciruitry to prevent voltage spike \n.SUBCKT mov1 1 2 ; base generic\n+PARAMS: VBO=10 Vr=0.71 Vratio=VBO/{Vr} exp=9\nB1 1 2 I=if(V(1, 2)-0.5, (V(1, 2) / Vratio) ** exp, (1 / Vratio) ** exp) tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}\nB2 2 1 I=if(V(2, 1)-0.5, (V(2, 1) / Vratio) ** exp, (1 / Vratio) ** exp) tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}\n.ENDS
